{"slug": "who-we-serve-building-together", "title": "Building together for other markets — Who we serve — SetuHashi", "description": "Japanese and Indian businesses creating opportunities together—in either country or other markets.", "mainClass": "main-serve", "scripts": [], "langHref": "/ja/who-we-serve-building-together/", "html": "<div class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"You are here\"><ol><li><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/who-we-serve/\">Who we serve</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Building together for other markets</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"layout\"><aside class=\"local\" aria-label=\"Who we serve\">\n<p class=\"local-k\"><a href=\"/en/who-we-serve/\">Who we serve</a></p>\n<p class=\"local-lead\">Different starting points. Possibilities in both directions.</p><p class=\"local-intro\">We work with Japanese and Indian businesses, organizations building opportunities together, the providers and institutions that support them, and government bodies connecting their regions with business.</p>\n<details class=\"local-d\" open><summary><span>In this section: Building together for other markets</span><span class=\"ln-count\">3 of 5</span></summary>\n<nav aria-label=\"In this section\"><ul class=\"ln\"><li><a href=\"/en/who-we-serve/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Japanese businesses</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/who-we-serve-indian-businesses/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Indian businesses</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/who-we-serve-building-together/\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Building together for other markets</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/who-we-serve-providers-and-institutions/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Providers and institutions</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/who-we-serve-government/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Government</span></a></li></ul></nav></details>\n</aside><article class=\"view\" aria-labelledby=\"vh\">\n<h1 id=\"vh\" class=\"v-h\">Building together for other markets</h1><p class=\"v-tag\">Japanese and Indian businesses creating opportunities together—in either country or other markets.</p>\n<div class=\"v-grid\"><div class=\"v-body\"><p>Japanese and Indian businesses may bring complementary technologies, capabilities, relationships or market access. The opportunity could be in Japan, India or another market.</p><p>We help the parties explore the shared opportunity, shape a combined offer and clarify how they would work together.</p><div class=\"v-q\"><p class=\"lab\">Your starting point might be</p><p>A joint offer, a combined bid, a new venture, or a partnership for renewal or succession.</p></div></div><div class=\"v-fig\"><figure class=\"fig fig-cor fig-cor5 fig-nav hi-joint\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Who we serve: Japanese businesses, Indian businesses, building together for other markets, providers and institutions, and government\" focusable=\"false\">\n<a class=\"box b-jp\" href=\"/en/who-we-serve/\" aria-label=\"Japanese businesses\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"12\" y=\"16\" width=\"164\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"94\" y=\"43.5\">Japanese</tspan> <tspan x=\"94\" y=\"64.5\">businesses</tspan></text></a>\n<a class=\"box b-in\" href=\"/en/who-we-serve-indian-businesses/\" aria-label=\"Indian businesses\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"224\" y=\"16\" width=\"164\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"306\" y=\"43.5\">Indian</tspan> <tspan x=\"306\" y=\"64.5\">businesses</tspan></text></a>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\"><g class=\"ar a-jp\"><path d=\"M180 38 H218\"/><path d=\"M210 32 L219 38 L210 44\"/></g>\n<g class=\"ar a-in\"><path d=\"M220 58 H182\"/><path d=\"M190 52 L181 58 L190 64\"/></g>\n<g class=\"ar a-joint\"><path d=\"M94 80 V100 H306 V80\"/><path d=\"M200 100 V116\"/><path d=\"M194 109 L200 118 L206 109\"/></g>\n<g class=\"ar a-sup\"><path d=\"M94 216 V198 H306 V216\"/><path d=\"M200 198 V184\"/></g></g>\n<a class=\"box b-joint on\" href=\"/en/who-we-serve-building-together/\" aria-label=\"Building together for other markets\" aria-current=\"page\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"92\" y=\"120\" width=\"216\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"200\" y=\"147.5\">Building together</tspan> <tspan x=\"200\" y=\"168.5\">for other markets</tspan></text></a>\n<a class=\"box b-prov\" href=\"/en/who-we-serve-providers-and-institutions/\" aria-label=\"Providers and institutions\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"12\" y=\"220\" width=\"164\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"94\" y=\"247.5\">Providers and</tspan> <tspan x=\"94\" y=\"268.5\">institutions</tspan></text></a>\n<a class=\"box b-gov\" href=\"/en/who-we-serve-government/\" aria-label=\"Government\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"224\" y=\"220\" width=\"164\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\"/><text text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"306\" y=\"258\">Government</tspan></text></a>\n</svg><figcaption><span class=\"fig-hint\">Select a box to open that view.</span></figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div class=\"onward\"><h2 class=\"lab\">Explore relevant services</h2><ul class=\"go\"><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-5/#s-5-1\">Develop new offers together</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-5/#s-5-2\">Pursue customers in other markets together</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-5/#s-5-3\">Plan for succession and renewal</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-3/#s-3-1\">Develop workable agreements</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-6/#s-6-1\">Bring organizations together to deliver</a></li></ul>\n<p class=\"acts\"><a class=\"btn btn-p\" href=\"/en/contact/?topic=a-joint\">Discuss your situation</a></p></div>\n<nav class=\"pager\" aria-label=\"Previous and next\"><a class=\"pg pg-prev\" href=\"/en/who-we-serve-indian-businesses/\"><span class=\"pg-k\">Previous</span>Indian businesses</a><a class=\"pg pg-next\" href=\"/en/who-we-serve-providers-and-institutions/\"><span class=\"pg-k\">Next</span>Pr